# Where `POST /api/ipfs` pins a new network's description (the create wizard's only upload).
# Unset it locally: it defaults to the dev stack's kubo at http://127.0.0.1:5001/api/v0/add?pin=true,
# and to Pinata's uploads API otherwise. IPFS_PIN_API_KEY is the bearer token Pinata needs.
# IPFS_PIN_API=https://uploads.pinata.cloud/v3/files
# IPFS_PIN_API_KEY=...
